    "summary_one_sentence": "During the Vietnam War, a military reconnaissance team sent to locate a missing platoon in an isolated valley discovers that the jungle is hunted by lethal prehistoric dinosaurs.",
    "summary_short": "Set against the backdrop of the Vietnam War, a search-and-rescue team is dispatched deep into a remote valley to investigate the sudden disappearance of a Green Beret squad. Expecting enemy combatants, the soldiers instead encounter aggressive, highly evolved dinosaurs that have survived hidden from humanity. Cut off from reinforcements, the unit must use their combat skills and limited firepower to survive both the unforgiving jungle and prehistoric predators. The film blends historical war tension with intense creature-feature horror.",
    "summary_long": "In the midst of the Vietnam War, a specialized reconnaissance unit named Vulture Squad is assigned a dangerous rescue mission. Their objective is to track down a missing platoon of soldiers who vanished without a trace inside an isolated and uncharted valley. Upon reaching the location, the team uncovers abandoned camps and disturbing evidence suggesting their comrades met a violent, inexplicable end. Before they can fall back, they realize they are trapped in a forgotten biosphere where ancient apex predators still thrive. Relentlessly stalked by packs of intelligent raptors and giant carnivores, the soldiers' combat training is pushed to its absolute limit. Paranoid and outmatched, internal tensions rise as the unit tries to formulate an escape strategy while suffering heavy casualties. Confronting an enemy immune to standard warfare tactics, they must rely on raw survival instincts to make it out of the valley alive. The story blends intense military action with classic survival horror elements, highlighting the chaos of human conflict colliding with primeval nature.",
